.TH GENESYS-OPTIMIZER-GUI 1 "2026-11-05" "GenESyS" "GenESyS Manual"
.SH NAME
genesys-optimizer-gui \- standalone GenESyS optimization Qt application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B genesys-optimizer-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B genesys-optimizer-gui
is an independent Qt6/C++23 application and process. It can also be launched
from the
.B Tools
menu of the main
.BR genesys-gui (1)
application by selecting
.BR "Optimization" .
The application opens its own optimizer window. Its scientific optimization functionality is experimental and it does not automatically share the active model in genesys-gui.
.PP
In the current Debian installation, the executable is installed in
.IR /usr/bin/ .
In the GenESyS portable distribution, it is installed in the runtime
.I libexec/genesys/system/bin
directory and a public command is provided by the portable installer.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR genesys-gui (1)
